      en: "Piz della Drausa Nord (3280 m) is the northern subsidiary peak of Piz della Drausa, straddling the Swiss-Italian border. It is a rocky, remote summit rarely visited. The border runs along the ridge. The climb involves scrambling over boulders. Remnants of a small glacier persist on the north side. The view takes in the Val Müstair and Italian peaks.",
